# Toolkits — the marketplace, as a workbook

Our toolkit marketplace (`web/toolkits`, a Python-generated pile of HTML) rebuilt as a **`.work`
workbook**: the catalog is the island's data (the source of truth, replacing `catalog.json`), and a
`client` island renders the browse grid + filters + detail. Logos travel with the workbook (served as
static assets). Each toolkit is a federation/render/knowledge unit you compose into a workbook.

client :market do
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Geist+Mono:wght@500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    :root{--paper:#16171a;--card:#1f2125;--ink:#ecebe5;--dim:#8c9189;--line:#2d2f34;--mint:#aee5c2;--sans:'Geist',system-ui,sans-serif;--mono:'Geist Mono',monospace}
    body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:15px/1.55 var(--sans)}
    .wrap{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 24px 100px}
    h1{font-size:30px;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 6px}
    .lead{color:var(--dim);margin:0 0 26px;max-width:60ch}
    .filters{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0 0 24px}
    .pill{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);color:var(--dim);font:600 12px var(--mono);padding:6px 12px;border-radius:20px;cursor:pointer}
    .pill.on{color:#11231a;background:var(--mint);border-color:var(--mint)}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:14px}
    .tk{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;transition:transform .12s,border-color .12s}
    .tk:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:#3a3d44}
    .tk .top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
    .tk .lg{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:8px;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none}
    .tk .lg img{width:22px;height:22px}
    .tk .t{font-weight:650;font-size:16px}
    .tk .tag{color:var(--dim);font-size:13px;line-height:1.5}
    .tk .meta{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:auto}
    .badge{font:600 10px var(--mono);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:5px;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--dim)}
    .badge.st{color:var(--mint)}
    .detail{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.6);display:none;place-items:center;padding:24px;z-index:10}
    .detail.on{display:grid}
    .dcard{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;max-width:560px;width:100%;padding:28px;max-height:85vh;overflow:auto}
    .dcard h2{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:22px} .dcard .dtag{color:var(--dim);margin:0 0 16px}
    .dcard .desc{color:#cfcfc9;line-height:1.65;margin:0 0 16px}
    .kv{display:flex;gap:8px;margin:6px 0;font-size:13px} .kv b{color:var(--dim);font:600 11px var(--mono);text-transform:uppercase;min-width:90px}
    .kv code{font:12px var(--mono);color:var(--mint)}
    .dclose{float:right;border:0;background:none;color:var(--dim);font-size:22px;cursor:pointer}
  </style>

  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Toolkits</h1>
    <p class="lead">Composable units — federations, renderers, knowledge packs — you drop into a workbook. Each carries its own backend, capabilities, and config.</p>
    <div class="filters" id="filters"></div>
    <div class="grid" id="grid"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="detail" id="detail"><div class="dcard" id="dcard"></div></div>

  <script>
